        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Walt Aldridge, Adam Levine, Gary Baker, Barry Billings, Chalmers Davis, Michael Dillon\n- Groups: The Shooters, Gym Class Heroes, Maroon 5\n- Song: \"Stereo Hearts\"\n\nFacts:\n- Walt Aldridge was born on November 12, 1955, in Florence, Alabama.\n- Walt Aldridge is an American musician, singer, songwriter, engineer, and record producer.\n- Adam Levine was born on March 18, 1979.\n- Adam Levine is an American singer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, actor, and record producer.\n- The Shooters consisted of Walt Aldridge on guitar and lead vocals, Gary Baker on bass guitar, Barry Billings on guitar, Chalmers Davis on keyboards, and Michael Dillon on drums.\n- \"Stereo Hearts\" is a song by the American group Gym Class Heroes featuring Adam Levine.\n- Adam Levine is the lead singer of Maroon 5.",
